Subject: [PATCH 18/44] docs: the SenseNova-Loop-9B Metal recipe

Records the model's shape, the two converter mappings that matter (the
zero-centred norms and the loader's namespace), how to serve it, and the
measurements taken on an M3 Ultra: 10.77 tok/s decode against a 123.7 plain
control, prefill 150.2, and 64/64 parity on two of three prompts with the third
breaking at a rank-2 near-tie. Names the open cost, the vision and context gaps,
and credits SenseNova for the model and ashhart/TensorFold for the engine.
